# Cleaner groups enabled by the automatic system-wide cleanup.
#
# Available groups:
#   safe       Built-in browser/desktop caches and conservative app caches
#   desktop    Desktop, messenger, browser, and editor caches
#   gaming     Steam, Lutris, Wine, Proton, and GPU caches
#   developer  CLI, IDE, package-build, and crash-report caches
#
# Keep all groups enabled to preserve the default behavior. Remove a group
# when the associated applications should not be touched automatically.
EnabledGroups=safe,desktop,gaming,developer
